{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2021-07-23 12:37:00', 'title': 'DALVANCE® (DALBAVANCIN) RECEIVES FDA APPROVAL TO TREAT ACUTE BACTERIAL SKIN AND SKIN STRUCTURE INFECTIONS IN PEDIATRIC PATIENTS', 'text': 'NORTH CHICAGO, ILL., JULY 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBVIE (NYSE: ABBV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) APPROVED DALVANCE®\xa0(DALBAVANCIN) FOR THE TREATMENT OF ACUTE BACTERIAL SKIN AND SKIN STRUCTURE INFECTIONS (ABSSSI) IN PEDIATRIC PATIENTS FROM BIRTH.'}